# shadcn/ui (going forward)

postN uses **shadcn/ui** (Base UI, Nova, Lucide) in `apps/web`. Config: `apps/web/components.json`. Components live in `apps/web/src/components/ui`.

## New UI

- Import from `@/components/ui/*` (Button, Input, Card, Dialog, Tabs, etc.).
- Add missing pieces with `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <name> -c apps/web` — do not hand-roll a parallel primitive.
- Icons: `lucide-react`. Class names: `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Keep the postN dark gold theme (tokens in `globals.css`). Do not reset `:root` to Nova light defaults.

## Do not rewrite

Leave existing screens and hand-rolled buttons as they are unless the user asks to migrate them. Compose, sidebar, calendar, posts, settings, channels — no drive-by shadcn swaps.

```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"

<Button>Save</Button>
<Button variant="outline">Cancel</Button>
```
